{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7472996e-c4ff-80a1-aead-9959732ca6b1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:51:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:50:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about the water at the end of my street. 4 Old Beach Road, the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 4 Old Beach Road. What's it doing down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The low spot at the end of the block is under about a foot of water. Still. It's been three days since that nor'easter, Friday and Saturday, and it hasn't gone down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot. Okay, I'm writing that down. Is it moving at all or just sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sitting. Cars are slowing to a crawl going through it. Somebody's going to stall out one of these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Has the drain there been clogged before, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's always like this after a big one. Nobody ever seems to come. So when did they last come by? Do you have that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the log for that area. [pause] I'm not seeing a recent entry for that spot, so I can't tell you a date. I'll put in a request for a crew to check the drain today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you call me when they do? My text messages are coming in hours late lately, so a call is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166, Joel, 4 Old Beach Road. I'll get it over to the crew supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks."
    }
  ],
